      "content": "i guess. but resting doesn't really fix the fact that i'm fundamentally not part of this world. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing eventually does. sometimes i think maybe the only way to actually stop feeling this weird disconnect is to just stop trying to exist in this space. does that make any sense?",
